stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> QUEUED: predictive permit
    [*] --> RESERVED: progressive permit (agent + borrower claimed)
    QUEUED --> INITIATED: dispatch
    RESERVED --> INITIATED: dispatch
    INITIATED --> RINGING
    RINGING --> ANSWERED
    ANSWERED --> CONNECTED: agent claimed
    ANSWERED --> COMPLETED: no agent (abandoned)
    CONNECTED --> COMPLETED
    RINGING --> FAILED: no answer
    INITIATED --> FAILED: rejected / not found at provider
    QUEUED --> CANCELLED: permit or lease expired
    RESERVED --> CANCELLED: lease expired
    ANSWERED --> COMPLETED: agent lost
